        <activityName xml:lang="en">Footpath, AC base layer, 30% recycling</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Footpath, AC base layer, 30% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: f43815f5-31d1-451e-ab4b-e550ea5303b7
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 AC base layer for a footpath in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 55 mm, service life 40 years. 30 % recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f43815f5-31d1-451e-ab4b-e550ea5303b7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
